<title>USA: Hormel Foods inks Costa Rican agreement.</title>
<headline>Hormel Foods inks Costa Rican agreement.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Minn. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hormel Foods Corp said it signed a joint marketing venture with Cinta Azul SA of San Jose, Costa Rica, a move that will expand its distribution operation in Central America.</p>
<p>Cinta Azul markets ready-to-eat sausage, ham, bacon, luncheon meat products and canned foods to retail and food service operations, Hormel said. Cinta Azul's presence in the dry grocery segment is expected to increase significantly because of the agreement, Hormel said.</p>
<p>Hormel is a multinational consumer foods company.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading down 1/8 Friday at 25.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
